lack of faith in government health services, women preferred to seek care from private providers."}, {"study_index": 60,
"title": "Evaluation of a cluster‐randomized controlled trial of a package of community‐based maternal and newborn      
interventions in Mirzapur, Bangladesh", "abstract": "BACKGROUND To evaluate a delivery strategy for newborn             
