Review: Community‐based intervention packages for reducing maternal and neonatal morbidity and mortality and improving 
neonatal outcomes
Total studies to screen: 20

SELECTION CRITERIA:
All prospective randomised, cluster‐randomised and quasi‐randomised trials evaluating the effectiveness of 
community‐based intervention packages in reducing maternal and neonatal mortality and morbidities, and improving 
neonatal outcomes.

INSTRUCTIONS: For each study below, decide INCLUDE or EXCLUDE.
