strengthening linkages with the local health systems. Some of the recent community‐based studies of interventions       
targeting women of reproductive age have shown variable impacts on maternal outcomes and hence it is uncertain if these 
strategies have consistent benefit across the continuum of maternal and newborn care.                                   
                                                                                                                        
Review objective:                                                                                                       
